WEBVTT

00:07:26.636 --> 00:07:30.116
which gradually grew
more and more personal,

00:07:30.116 --> 00:07:32.636
up to the point
where we would ask participants

00:07:32.676 --> 00:07:36.836
to share possibly very delicate
information about themselves.

00:07:37.756 --> 00:07:40.476
Now, considering the findings
from prior research,

00:07:40.516 --> 00:07:43.836
such as the one from the US Army before,

00:07:43.876 --> 00:07:48.116
we expected that people
would apply more social rules

00:07:48.116 --> 00:07:51.036
in their interactions
with these humanlike bots

00:07:51.076 --> 00:07:52.716
and act accordingly.

00:07:53.596 --> 00:07:55.276
So what did we find?

00:07:56.556 --> 00:07:58.156
Well, exactly that.

00:07:58.156 --> 00:08:02.036
So participants interacting
with our humanlike bots